from zero to 10

00:02:58.411 --> 00:03:00.914 align:start size:94% position:6%
how strongly
I feel I have each symptom

00:03:00.914 --> 00:03:04.250 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'll total it up and divide it
by the number of symptoms.

00:03:04.250 --> 00:03:06.252 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Light laughter ]
"If I'm higher than five,

00:03:06.252 --> 00:03:08.288 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'll seek
professional treatment."

00:03:08.288 --> 00:03:08.955 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:08.955 --> 00:03:13.226
"If I'm under five, I'll
self-diagnose that I am A-okay."

00:03:13.226 --> 00:03:14.661 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:14.661 --> 00:03:16.262 align:start size:94% position:6%
Number one --
"Are you the type of perso

00:03:16.262 --> 00:03:19.632 align:start size:94% position:6%
who has to check the stove
over and over again

00:03:19.632 --> 00:03:20.967 size:84% position:42% line:92%
to make sure it's off?"

00:03:20.967 --> 00:03:23.403 line:92%
And I'm, like, "Uh, zero.

00:03:23.403 --> 00:03:25.305 line:92%
That's 'Looney Tunes' land."

00:03:25.305 --> 00:03:26.372 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:26.372 --> 00:03:29.275 align:start size:94% position:6%
Number two --
"Are you the type of perso

00:03:29.275 --> 00:03:33.479 align:start size:94% position:6%
who has to wash your hands
repeatedly?"

00:03:33.479 --> 00:03:36.249 line:92%
And I had this nagging feeling

00:03:36.249 --> 00:03:39.452 size:84% position:42%
that I forgot to answer
that first question.

00:03:39.452 --> 00:03:41.120 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:41.120 --> 00:03:43.556 align:start size:94% position:6%
So, I looked up.
Yeah, I did write zero.

00:03:43.556 --> 00:03:45.225 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Okay, hand washing?

00:03:45.225 --> 00:03:47.026 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
Six.

00:03:47.026 --> 00:03:47.994 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'm, like,
"That ain't even right."

00:03:47.994 --> 00:03:50.263 align:start size:94% position:6%
I scribbled that out.
I got some ink on my hands

00:03:50.263 --> 00:03:52.665 align:start size:94% position:6%
I went to go wash my hands
[ Laughter ]

00:03:52.665 --> 00:03:53.633 line:92%
While I'm washing my hands

00:03:53.633 --> 00:03:55.401 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'm like,
"Why did they mention stove?

00:03:55.401 --> 00:03:56.603 size:88% position:44% line:92%
So, I checked the stove.

00:03:56.603 --> 00:03:57.870 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
It was on.

00:03:57.870 --> 00:03:59.706 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'm like, "I'm never going t
make that mistake again,"

00:03:59.706 --> 00:04:03.443 align:start size:94% position:6%
and I came back, and
I changed hand washing to two.

00:04:03.443 --> 00:04:04.644 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:04:04.644 --> 00:04:07.513 align:start size:94% position:6%
I did the whole test
and averaged 5.0.

00:04:07.513 --> 00:04:09.382 align:start size:94% position:6%
So I'm like,
"I still don't know."

00:04:09.382 --> 00:04:10.750 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:04:10.750 --> 00:04:14.420 align:start size:94% position:6%
So, I decided
to buy a book about it.

00:04:14.420 --> 00:04:16.856
I got to get to the bottom of it
somehow, right?

00:04:16.856 --> 00:04:19.392 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Light laughter ]
I go into the bookstore.

00:04:19.392 --> 00:04:19.926 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
I ask the clerk,

00:04:19.926 --> 00:04:21.828 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Can you tell me where
the self-help section is?"

00:04:21.828 --> 00:04:25.999
And she said, "Why don't you try
to find that yourself?"

00:04:25.999 --> 00:04:27.100 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:04:27.100 --> 00:04:29.469 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Audience groans ]

00:04:29.469 --> 00:04:31.371 align:start size:94% position:6%
Well,
I finally found the section.

00:04:31.371 --> 00:04:32.105 size:84% position:42% line:92%
It was so disorganized,

00:04:32.105 --> 00:04:35.475
